<title>POLAND: BWR to lead PLN 15 mln Bytom muni bond.</title>
<headline>BWR to lead PLN 15 mln Bytom muni bond.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Wspolpracy Regionalnej (BWR) was picked as a lead manager of a 15-million zloty non-public issue of five-year bonds of southern Polish municipality of Bytom, BWR said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bank said the issue of 1,500 shares would be directed to less than 300 selected investors.</p>
<p>Earlier Bytom spokesman has said that the bonds would be issued by mid-1997 and the proceeds from the issue would be used for renovation of the city's commercial centre.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
